6 | #[derive(AceSerialize)]
  |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^ ace: this Option field's inner type is itself an Option
  |
  = help: the trait `ace_serialize::schema::NonOptional` is not implemented for `std::option::Option<i32>`
  = note: ace: an Option field may nest at most one Option; nested Option has no wire mapping (FR-T02)
  = help: the following other types implement trait `ace_serialize::schema::NonOptional`:
            &str
            BTreeMap<K, V>
            Box<T>
            DateTime
            DateTimeOffset
            Guid
            Holder
            IntPtr
          and $N others
  = note: required for `std::option::Option<std::option::Option<i32>>` to implement `AceDecodeCyclic`
  = note: this error originates in the derive macro `AceSerialize` (in Nightly builds, run with -Z macro-backtrace for more info)

